# Soma Notes 0.1.0 (Boss, 2026-10-23): a standalone app, dev.omalauncher.notes. Notes live in ~/Notes on the Mac Pro,
# served by tailshare-serve's /v1/notes; the phone keeps a copy and works offline. A new note is a whole blank page,
# first line the title (Boss: "like a blank notes page, full screen"); Quick capture is the little sheet for later.
# The emulator reaches the Mac Pro's tailshare-serve through the Mac it runs on.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
rotate portrait
fold folded
launch dev.omalauncher.notes/.MainActivity
wait 2500
expect Notes
# The search field's "Search notes" is a placeholder uiautomator can't read: the filters stand in.
expect From agents
shot stream-cover
# A new note: a whole page, the keyboard up, "Title" waiting.
tap 0.86 0.88
wait 1500
expect ‹ Notes
expect Hold to talk
shot new-page-blank
type Walk groceries
key ENTER
tap ☐ List
type Milk
key ENTER
type Eggs
wait 800
# Look: the first line set big as the title; two checklist lines; Enter carried the box on.
shot new-page-typed
key BACK
key BACK
wait 2500
expect Walk groceries
expect TODAY
shot stream-with-note
# Sent to the Mac within a few seconds (SYNCED at the top; OFFLINE if the Mac Pro's /v1/notes isn't up yet).
wait 4000
expect SYNCED
# Read it: the boxes tick.
tap Walk groceries
wait 1500
tap Read
wait 2000
expect Milk
shot reader-list
tap Milk
wait 1500
shot reader-milk-ticked
tap Source
wait 800
expect - [x] Milk
key BACK
wait 800
# Quick capture, as the launcher or another app's Share opens it.
# Quoted twice: walk.py hands the line to the phone's shell, which would split the text at its spaces.
shell am start -a android.intent.action.SEND -t text/plain --es android.intent.extra.TEXT "'Walk shared link https://example.com'" -n dev.omalauncher.notes/.QuickCaptureActivity
wait 1500
expect QUICK CAPTURE
expect Walk shared link
shot quick-capture-shared
tap Save
wait 1500
launch dev.omalauncher.notes/.MainActivity
wait 1500
expect Walk shared link
# Unfolded: the stream at the left, the note beside it.
fold open
wait 2500
tap Walk groceries
wait 1500
expect Hold to talk
shot unfolded-two-panes
# Sideways, an agent note reads as a two-page book (needs one in ~/Notes/Agents on the Mac Pro).
rotate landscape
wait 2000
tap From agents
wait 1000
shot landscape-agents
rotate portrait
fold folded
# Folded, the cover still shows the note opened in the right pane, under the "From agents" filter: back to the whole list.
tap ‹ Notes
wait 1200
tap All
wait 1000
expect Walk shared link
# Swipes, as Apple's Notes and Mail have them (Boss, 2026-10-24): right pins, left deletes with a moment to undo.
# The top card's place on the cover (the stream's first card under its stack's name).
swipe 0.2 0.34 0.75 0.34 300
wait 1200
expect PINNED
shot swiped-right-pinned
swipe 0.2 0.34 0.75 0.34 300
wait 1200
absent PINNED
# Left, all the way: gone, with Undo; Undo brings it back.
swipe 0.85 0.34 0.1 0.34 300
wait 500
# Undo lasts 5 s and each look at the screen takes about 2: the bar's UNDO by its place (the bar's own words, left of
# the + button; for "Walk shared link" it sits at 0.57), right after one check; "tap UNDO" would come too late.
expect UNDO
tap 0.57 0.90
shot swiped-left-undo-bar
wait 1200
expect Walk shared link
expect Walk groceries
# A short swipe springs back and does nothing.
swipe 0.5 0.34 0.4 0.34 200
wait 1000
absent UNDO
absent PINNED
# Clean up: delete both walk notes (they go to ~/Notes/.trash on the Mac).
tap Walk groceries
wait 1200
tap Delete
wait 600
# The dialog's DELETE button by where it is: "tap Delete" would find the title, "Delete this note?", first.
tap 0.84 0.58
wait 1200
tap Walk shared link
wait 1500
tap Delete
wait 600
# The dialog's DELETE button by where it is: "tap Delete" would find the title, "Delete this note?", first.
tap 0.84 0.58
wait 1500
absent Walk groceries
absent Walk shared link
[phone] Hold the red + and say "buy coffee filters": a page opens with those words (Android asks for the microphone the first time).
[phone] On a page, hold "Hold to talk", speak, let go: the words go in at the cursor.
[phone] In Chrome, Share a page to Soma Notes: Quick capture drops down with the link; Save, and it is in the stream.
[phone] Turn Wi-Fi and mobile data off, write a note: the stream says OFFLINE · 1 TO SEND; back online, it says SYNCED and the note is in ~/Notes on the Mac Pro.
[phone] Unfolded and sideways, open an agent's Markdown note: two pages a spread, a tap at the right turns the page.
[phone] Open an agent's HTML note: it fits the screen and pinches to zoom.
